Cell["\<\
This Demonstration is meant to help students understand how, based on the \
central limit theorem, the sampling distribution of a skewed population \
distribution will become normally distributed.\
\>", "Text",
 TaggingRules->{},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5162174880835314`*^9, 3.516217585087079*^9}, {
  3.516383655316083*^9, 3.5163836555211034`*^9}, {3.516480552356645*^9, 
  3.5164805527917967`*^9}},
 CellID->604095604,ExpressionUUID->"ac7014be-1922-4575-b65f-77d64fbf7496"]
}, Closed]],

